cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite both this repository and the HunyuanOCR technical report."
title: "HunyuanOCR-ROCm: an evaluation-backed AMD ROCm port of HunyuanOCR-1.5"
abstract: >-
  Tooling to run Tencent HunyuanOCR-1.5 on AMD gfx1100 (RDNA3) across three
  inference backends (llama.cpp, vLLM, transformers) and score them on
  OmniDocBench v1.6. Evaluation-backed, not precision-aligned.
authors:
